<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
